$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0>Xaos" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Raining" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> are at it again on a small, yet familiar playing field.  Flags are located down in the hole, so retrieval will be a bit more difficult.  Capture the other team's flag and bring it back to your base to score!";